# Threat model covered here:
# - On-chain program IDs (declare_id! sites)
# - Error code enums (Anchor assigns codes by variant position; reordering or
#   inserting in the middle silently breaks deployed clients - see CLAUDE.md)
# - Anchor / Cargo build configuration (toolchain, deps, workspace layout)
# - Mainnet deploy and verification workflows
# - The repo-guard itself (config, script, workflow) - so it cannot be
#   disabled without a security signoff

